   "source": "OpenAI, The Selmer converse for elliptic curves at every prime, OpenAI Math Release preprint (openai/math, preprints/The-Selmer-converse-for-elliptic-curves-at-every-prime-September-24-2026), LaTeX source build/sections/07-cusp-lifting.tex at commit adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a",
